{"availability":"available","full":"aws-samples/amazon-transcribe-live-meeting-assistant","name":"amazon-transcribe-live-meeting-assistant","description":"Live Meeting Assistant (LMA) - AI-powered live meeting transcription, translation, summarization, and assistant using Amazon Transcribe, Amazon Bedrock, and other AWS AI services","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":168,"forks":57,"created":"2024-04-11T17:28:55Z","updated":"2026-10-19T02:33:02Z","license":"MIT","branch":"develop","homepage":"https://aws-samples.github.io/amazon-transcribe-live-meeting-assistant/","topics":["ai","amazon-bedrock","amazon-transcribe","aws","meeting-assistant","real-time","summarization","transcription"],"demo":"https://aws-samples.github.io/amazon-transcribe-live-meeting-assistant/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:57.063Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:57.063Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:57.063Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T23:11:54.513Z","stars":166,"forks":57},{"at":"2026-10-15T12:58:43.740Z","stars":168,"forks":57},{"at":"2026-10-19T18:04:57.063Z","stars":168,"forks":57}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Companion AWS blog post: Live Meeting Assistant with Amazon Transcribe, Amazon Bedrock, and Strands Agents","You've likely experienced the challenge of taking notes during a meeting while trying to pay attention to the conversation. You've probably also experienced the need to quickly fact-check something that's been said, or look up information to answer a question that's just been asked in the call. Or maybe you have a team member that always joins meetings late, and expects you to send them a quick summary over chat to catch them up.","All of this, and more, is now possible with the Live Meeting Assistant (LMA)."],"features":["Live transcription with speaker attribution — Powered by Amazon Transcribe with custom vocabulary and language model support","Live translation — 75+ languages via Amazon Translate","AI meeting assistant — Strands Agents SDK with Amazon Bedrock, with built-in tools for transcript search, web search, document search, and meeting history","MCP server integration — Extend the assistant with external tools (Salesforce, Amazon Quick Suite, custom servers)","On-demand and automatic summaries — Generate summaries, action items, and insights during and after meetings"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/amazon-transcribe-live-meeting-assistant/blob/develop/README.md","fingerprint":"f496b44d0404d44f00cb406397bdb3b5e78102728fe5b859d49437746dbbf07c","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T23:11:54.631Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:57.167Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Companion AWS blog post: Live Meeting Assistant with Amazon Transcribe, Amazon Bedrock, and Strands Agents","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/amazon-transcribe-live-meeting-assistant/blob/develop/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f496b44d0404d44f00cb406397bdb3b5e78102728fe5b859d49437746dbbf07c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/amazon-transcribe-live-meeting-assistant/blob/develop/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:57.167Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-19T02:33:02Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aws-samples/amazon-transcribe-live-meeting-assistant/blob/develop/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:57.168Z","hash":"f496b44d0404d44f00cb406397bdb3b5e78102728fe5b859d49437746dbbf07c","originalBytes":6831,"storedBytes":6831,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:04:57.063Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"AI & machine learning","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Apple","MCP servers & agents","Chatbots & assistants"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHea